    "title": "Bitcoin Price Holds Near $65,000 as Nvidia Turmoil Drags Nasdaq Down 2.5%",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-holds-near-65000-nvidia",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Pics-23.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-holds-near-65000-nvidia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Holds Near $65,000 as Nvidia Turmoil Drags Nasdaq Down 2.5%</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin price held near $65,000 on Monday afternoon, shrugging off a 2.5% Nasdaq slide as Nvidia's board ruled out bringing back Jensen Huang and the dollar hit a 19-month high.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-holds-near-65000-nvidia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Holds Near $65,000 as Nvidia Turmoil Drags Nasdaq Down 2.5%</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Pics-23.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-holds-near-65000-nvidia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Holds Near $65,000 as Nvidia Turmoil Drags Nasdaq Down 2.5%</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin price held near $65,000 on Monday afternoon, shrugging off a 2.5% Nasdaq slide as Nvidia's board ruled out bringing back Jensen Huang and the dollar hit a 19-month high.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-holds-near-65000-nvidia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Holds Near $65,000 as Nvidia Turmoil Drags Nasdaq Down 2.5%</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
