    "title": "Senate Agriculture Committee to Hear Trump’s CFTC Nominees Tuesday",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/cftc-nominees-senate-hearing-tuesday",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Senate-Democrats-Press-DOJ-Treasury-to-Probe-Binance-Over-Trump-Ties-Iran-Sanctions-Allegations.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/cftc-nominees-senate-hearing-tuesday\" rel=\"nofollow\">Senate Agriculture Committee to Hear Trump&#8217;s CFTC Nominees Tuesday</a></p>\n<p>The Senate Agriculture Committee will hear Nathan Anonick and Matthew Rowland on Tuesday, President Trump's bipartisan picks to join CFTC Chairman Michael Selig, currently the agency's only sitting commissioner.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/cftc-nominees-senate-hearing-tuesday\" rel=\"nofollow\">Senate Agriculture Committee to Hear Trump&#8217;s CFTC Nominees Tuesday</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Senate-Democrats-Press-DOJ-Treasury-to-Probe-Binance-Over-Trump-Ties-Iran-Sanctions-Allegations.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/cftc-nominees-senate-hearing-tuesday\" rel=\"nofollow\">Senate Agriculture Committee to Hear Trump&#8217;s CFTC Nominees Tuesday</a></p>\n<p>The Senate Agriculture Committee will hear Nathan Anonick and Matthew Rowland on Tuesday, President Trump's bipartisan picks to join CFTC Chairman Michael Selig, currently the agency's only sitting commissioner.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/cftc-nominees-senate-hearing-tuesday\" rel=\"nofollow\">Senate Agriculture Committee to Hear Trump&#8217;s CFTC Nominees Tuesday</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
