    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H5bi8hBMDTw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/H5bi8hBMDTw/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin-H5bi8hBMDTw.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin\" rel=\"nofollow\">T. Rowe Price’s Blue Macellari: Institutions “Not Backing Away” From Bitcoin</a></p>\n<p>For institutions, Blue Macellari says Bitcoin is no longer about whether to own it or whether it is real.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin\" rel=\"nofollow\">T. Rowe Price’s Blue Macellari: Institutions “Not Backing Away” From Bitcoin</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H5bi8hBMDTw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/H5bi8hBMDTw/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin-H5bi8hBMDTw.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin\" rel=\"nofollow\">T. Rowe Price’s Blue Macellari: Institutions “Not Backing Away” From Bitcoin</a></p>\n<p>For institutions, Blue Macellari says Bitcoin is no longer about whether to own it or whether it is real.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/t-rowe-prices-blue-macellari-institutions-not-backing-away-from-bitcoin\" rel=\"nofollow\">T. Rowe Price’s Blue Macellari: Institutions “Not Backing Away” From Bitcoin</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
