    "title": "$36B Wealth Firm Strategist: Bitcoin’s Supercycle Is “Still Intact”",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m7ygyYMe3mg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/m7ygyYMe3mg/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact-m7ygyYMe3mg.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact\" rel=\"nofollow\">$36B Wealth Firm Strategist: Bitcoin’s Supercycle Is “Still Intact”</a></p>\n<p>James Thorne, Chief Market Strategist at Wellington-Altus, tells BMTV that Bitcoin's super cycle is still intact after the drop from about 83,000 in mid-October to around 64,000.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact\" rel=\"nofollow\">$36B Wealth Firm Strategist: Bitcoin’s Supercycle Is “Still Intact”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m7ygyYMe3mg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/m7ygyYMe3mg/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact-m7ygyYMe3mg.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact\" rel=\"nofollow\">$36B Wealth Firm Strategist: Bitcoin’s Supercycle Is “Still Intact”</a></p>\n<p>James Thorne, Chief Market Strategist at Wellington-Altus, tells BMTV that Bitcoin's super cycle is still intact after the drop from about 83,000 in mid-October to around 64,000.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/36b-wealth-firm-strategist-bitcoins-supercycle-is-still-intact\" rel=\"nofollow\">$36B Wealth Firm Strategist: Bitcoin’s Supercycle Is “Still Intact”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
